auth-sign-in-title = Sign in
auth-sign-in-description = Sign in to Breadator to keep your saved formulas, starters and bakes on every device. An account is optional.
auth-sign-in-lead = You do not need an account to use Breadator. Sign in only if you want your saved formulas, starters and bake journal on all your devices.
auth-email-heading = With your email address
auth-email-label = Email address
auth-email-hint = We email you a link that signs you in once. No password to remember.
auth-email-send = Email me a sign-in link
auth-providers-heading = Or continue with
auth-with-provider = Continue with { $provider }
auth-passkey-heading = With a passkey
auth-passkey-hint = Use the fingerprint, face or screen lock of this device, or a security key you registered earlier.
auth-passkey-button = Sign in with a passkey
auth-privacy = We keep your email address to sign you in and nothing else: no tracking, no ads. You can download or delete everything from your account page.
auth-closed = Accounts are not open yet. Everything on Breadator works without one: the formulas you save stay on this device.
auth-error-email = That does not look like an email address. Check it and try again.
auth-check-title = Check your inbox
auth-check-text = If { $email } is correct, a sign-in link is on its way.
auth-check-hint = The link works once and expires in 15 minutes. Nothing there? Look in your spam folder, or try again.
auth-check-retry = Use another address or send the link again
auth-check-link-text = An account already uses { $email }. To link your { $provider } account to it, open the link we just sent to that address: it signs you in and links the two.
auth-verify-title = Finish signing in
auth-verify-who = This link signs in to the Breadator account of { $email }.
auth-verify-who-link = This link signs in to the Breadator account of { $email } and links your { $provider } account to it.
auth-verify-warning = Press the button only if you asked for this link yourself. If someone else sent it to you, close this page: you would be signed in to their account, and what this device has saved would be copied into it.
auth-verify-button = Sign in
auth-too-many-title = Too many attempts
auth-too-many-text = Please wait a little while before asking for another link or trying again.
auth-link-invalid-title = This link no longer works
auth-link-invalid-text = Sign-in links work once and expire after 15 minutes. Ask for a new one.
auth-oauth-state-title = Sign-in did not complete
auth-oauth-state-text = The sign-in request expired or did not start from this browser. Please start again.
auth-oauth-cancelled-title = Sign-in cancelled
auth-oauth-cancelled-text = Nothing was changed. You can try again whenever you like.
auth-oauth-failed-title = The provider did not answer
auth-oauth-failed-text = We could not complete the sign-in with that provider. Please try again in a moment, or use another method.
auth-oauth-no-email-title = No verified email address
auth-oauth-no-email-text = That account has no verified email address that we can use. Verify one with the provider, or use another sign-in method.
auth-oauth-elsewhere-title = Already linked to another account
auth-oauth-elsewhere-text = That account is already linked to a different Breadator account. Unlink it there first.
auth-back-home = Back to Breadator
auth-back-sign-in = Back to sign-in
auth-passkey-error-unsupported = This browser cannot use passkeys.
auth-passkey-error-failed = The passkey was not accepted. Try again or use another method.
auth-passkey-error-cancelled = The passkey request was cancelled.

email-signin-subject = Your Breadator sign-in link
email-signin-intro = Use the button below to sign in to Breadator. Nobody can sign in without this email.
email-signin-button = Sign in to Breadator
email-signin-expiry = The link works once and expires in 15 minutes.
email-signin-ignore = If you did not ask for it, ignore this message: nothing happens.
email-link-subject = Confirm signing in to Breadator with { $provider }
email-link-intro = Someone signed in to Breadator with a { $provider } account that uses this address, and this address already has a Breadator account. If it was you, use the button below: it links that { $provider } account to yours and signs you in.
email-link-button = Link and sign in
email-link-ignore = If it was not you, ignore this message: nothing is linked and nobody is signed in.

