account-units-hint = You always type grams and degrees Celsius. With US units, the weights and temperatures of the results also show ounces, pounds and °F. The switch at the bottom of every page does the same for this device alone.
account-methods = Ways to sign in
account-methods-lead = Any of these signs you in to this account. You can add more or remove some, but one must always remain.
account-method-email = Email link
account-linked-on = linked on
account-unlink = Unlink
account-passkey = Passkey
account-added-on = added on
account-last-used = last used
account-remove = Remove
account-last-method = This is your only way to sign in, so it cannot be removed. Add another first.
account-passkey-add = Add a passkey
account-passkey-lead = A passkey lets you sign in with your fingerprint, face or screen lock instead of an email link.
account-passkey-name = Name of this passkey
account-passkey-name-placeholder = e.g. My laptop
account-passkey-added = Passkey added.
account-passkey-error-failed = The passkey could not be added.
account-passkey-error-duplicate = This passkey is already registered.
account-passkey-error-limit = You have reached the maximum number of passkeys. Remove one first.
account-devices = Signed-in devices
account-devices-lead = Browsers where you are signed in. Sign out of the ones you do not recognise.
account-this-device = this device
account-signed-in-on = signed in on
account-last-seen = last seen
account-revoke = Sign out
account-wipe-device = Also remove the formulas saved on this device
account-sign-out = Sign out of this device
account-sign-out-all = Sign out everywhere
account-device-unknown = Unknown device
account-data = Your data
account-data-lead = Download everything stored about you: profile, saved formulas, starters, bakes, calibration and chat history, as one JSON file.
account-download = Download my data
account-delete = Delete my account
account-delete-lead = This erases your account and everything synced to it, on the server and on every device. It cannot be undone. Formulas saved only on this device stay there unless you tick the box below.
account-delete-confirm = Type DELETE to confirm
account-delete-button = Delete my account for good
account-deleted-title = Account deleted
account-deleted-text = Your account and its data were deleted. Breadator still works without an account.
account-msg-saved = Saved.
account-msg-linked = Sign-in method added.
account-msg-revoked = Device signed out.
account-msg-passkey-removed = Passkey removed.
account-msg-identity-removed = Sign-in method unlinked.
account-err-last-method = You cannot remove your last way to sign in.
account-err-confirm = The confirmation word did not match, so nothing was deleted.

